        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "5 months ago",
        "text": "Mrs. Chantal is truly one of a kind! Her professionalism, warmth, and dedication are unmatched. From the moment I meet her, it’s clear that she genuinely cares about the clients and always goes above and beyond to ensure everything is handled with care and excellence.\nHer attention to detail, clear communication, and kind demeanor make every interaction a pleasure. She brings both heart and expertise to everything she does, and it's rare to find someone who combines both so effortlessly.\nHighly recommended without hesitation!",
        "time": 1758247213,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Vanessa May",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/118355068339620304287/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJN9edNyYAiGKJWw-RB_Oclre33A5Gh2q1zx606CwgI8yJKRw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "5 months ago",
        "text": "wonderful service\nsimple, clear explanations, accessible, friendly and happy staff\nthe storage area is clean\nno issues whatsoever\nhighly recommend for your storage needs",
        "time": 1756037303,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Linda Leduc",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103294143678406588758/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIOaSfENJyuds8QaYz1JeH_JToLCyRC8zc09q8allaE2D0vKA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 4,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Chantal, the office manager is amazing and offers great customer service. The only reason I gave a 4 is because I stopped using the storage one week before the end of the contract and did not get a reimbursement for that last week. I found that a little disappointing!",
        "time": 1732146595,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Debbie",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111651875801459933658/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocK8waPalcQKlWuwOcnfQBDy2aKOFtSHrwjIhhnZKsbij2ay-Q=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 months ago",
        "text": "I have recently dealt with the service staff at the Cité des Jeunes office. They were very helpful and provided excellent service. I would like to thank Chantal, in particular.\nThe pricing is comparable with others in a major metropolitan area, and the unit I rented was clean and dry (not climate controlled).\nTotally satisfied and will recommend to others!",
        "time": 1761052212,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Arielle Binette",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106069792393265562261/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVF1IRN1NcmcnY3nbSbeJYqbewEDhcrBQ8JBYhR47CRX3IrmFAXKw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "7 years ago",
        "text": "Very nice staff. Stored my stuff for 3 months, No issues with mice.\nThey offered me the best price and then when I showed up the guy even offered me more rebates due to me expecting a child. Made everything clear and was super accommodating when I needed one more day to move my things out.\nHighly recommended, will use again.",
